### Initiate Login (Get CAPTCHA)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login

> {% 
    client.global.set("login_session_id", response.body.data.login_session_id);
%}

### Verify Login (Submit Credentials)
# Replace YOUR_USERNAME, YOUR_PASSWORD, and CAPTCHA_TEXT with real values from the previous step's image
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login_session_id": "{{login_session_id}}",
  "username": "YOUR_USERNAME",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD",
  "captcha_text": "CAPTCHA_TEXT"
}

> {% 
    client.global.set("jwt_token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### Get Attendance
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attendance?semester=CH2025261
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Get Timetable
GET http://localhost:8080/api/timetable?semester=CH2025261
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Get Marks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/marks?semester=CH2025261
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Get Exam Schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exams?semester=CH2025261
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Get Grades History (CGPA)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Get Academic Calendar
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendar
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Get Available Semesters (Courses endpoint)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Get Faculty/Student Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/faculty
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
